                                "sense_id": "f8ffe727-5dd5-332d-82b1-0ee97ec28009",
                                "text": "This isn’t the first time she has hidden a weight-loss management attempt from her husband. “I went to Turkey and had a gastric balloon, and I didn’t tell anyone, not even him,” she says."
